OL,3,GNEWSATravel disrupted and events
OL,4,Acancelled as Storm Boelo hits UK with
OL,5,Awind and rain
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing more wet and
OL,8,Fwindy weather to large parts of the UK
OL,9,F- a day after Storm Austen hit the
OL,10,Fcountry
OL,12,FFerries in the Irish Sea are cancelled,
OL,13,Fsome Scottish rail lines will close
OL,14,Ffrom 21:00, while in Ireland, some
OL,15,Fflights to and from Dublin were
OL,16,Fcancelled - here's a travel round-up
OL,18,FMeanwhile, a marathon in the Eryri
OL,19,Fnational park in north Wales was called
OL,20,Foff, as well as a range of events in
OL,21,FEngland, Scotland, and Northern Ireland
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
